<div id="poster">

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       HEADER
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <header class="poster-header">
    <div class="conference-tag">Medical AI &amp; Digital Health Conference 2024</div>
    <h1 class="poster-title">Large Language Models in Medicine:<br>Opportunities, Risks, and the Path Forward</h1>
    <div class="header-rule"></div>
    <p class="poster-subtitle">
      A comprehensive review of how large language models are transforming clinical practice, medical research,
